# Keep the build context small and free of secrets/local cruft.
.git/
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
data/
output/
logs/
*.log
.env
.env.*
.mcp.json
# .claude/ holds LOCAL CONFIG (OAuth tokens - never ship) but also the
# candidate-communication SOPs that the drafter now reads at runtime. Exclude
# everything under it EXCEPT that one skill folder. Excluding the whole
# directory is why the build failed with:
#   failed to compute cache key: "/.claude/skills/01_candidate-communication": not found
.claude/*
!.claude/skills
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/01_candidate-communication
archive/
*.bak
C:/tmp
design-system/
docs/
SESSIONS.md
